[Paused by [toker](https://github.com/passcod/toker) at 08:00: the prompt cache expired after 2h idle, so the next message re-reads 200,000 tokens into the prompt cache. You can:
- `/compact`: pay the re-read once for a small prefix.
- Start a new session: pay nothing, keep none of this context.
- Reply: carry on and pay the re-read.

